---
// Colours are types; a chain only works when the types match.
---
<figure class="illus">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 480 196" role="img" aria-labelledby="types-art-t">
    <title id="types-art-t">食べる is a verb. Adding ない turns it into 食べない, an い-adjective, and adding た turns that into 食べなかった, still an い-adjective. Adding たい to 食べない fails, because たい needs a verb and 食べない is an い-adjective. Below, the six type colours: verb, い-adj, な-adj, noun, adverb and clause.</title>
    <rect class="il-blk type-verb" x="5" y="8" width="80" height="40" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="45" y="28">食べる</text>
    <text class="il-t il-p type-verb" x="45" y="62">verb</text>
    <path class="il-a" d="M87 28H98" /><path class="il-ah" d="M105 28l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <rect class="il-mach" x="105" y="14" width="46" height="28" rx="6" />
    <text class="il-t" x="128" y="28">ない</text>
    <path class="il-a" d="M153 28H162" /><path class="il-ah" d="M171 28l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <rect class="il-blk type-i-adj" x="171" y="8" width="100" height="40" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="221" y="28">食べない</text>
    <text class="il-t il-p type-i-adj" x="221" y="62">い-adj</text>
    <path class="il-a" d="M273 28H282" /><path class="il-ah" d="M291 28l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <rect class="il-mach" x="291" y="14" width="46" height="28" rx="6" />
    <text class="il-t" x="314" y="28">た</text>
    <path class="il-a" d="M339 28H348" /><path class="il-ah" d="M357 28l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <rect class="il-blk type-i-adj" x="357" y="8" width="118" height="40" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="416" y="28">食べなかった</text>
    <text class="il-t il-p type-i-adj" x="416" y="62">い-adj</text>
    <rect class="il-blk type-i-adj" x="5" y="88" width="100" height="40" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-t" x="55" y="108">食べない</text>
    <text class="il-t il-p type-i-adj" x="55" y="142">い-adj</text>
    <path class="il-bad" d="M107 108H118" /><path class="il-bad-h" d="M125 108l-9-5.5v11z" />
    <rect class="il-bad" x="125" y="94" width="46" height="28" rx="6" />
    <text class="il-t il-bad-t" x="148" y="108">たい</text>
    <path class="il-bad" d="M190 100l16 16M206 100l-16 16" />
    <text class="il-s il-l il-bad-t" x="221" y="108">たい needs a verb</text>
    <g>
      <rect class="il-pill type-verb" x="14" y="160" width="60" height="24" rx="12" /><text class="il-t il-p type-verb" x="44" y="172">verb</text>
      <rect class="il-pill type-i-adj" x="84" y="160" width="66" height="24" rx="12" /><text class="il-t il-p type-i-adj" x="117" y="172">い-adj</text>
      <rect class="il-pill type-na-adj" x="160" y="160" width="66" height="24" rx="12" /><text class="il-t il-p type-na-adj" x="193" y="172">な-adj</text>
      <rect class="il-pill type-noun" x="236" y="160" width="62" height="24" rx="12" /><text class="il-t il-p type-noun" x="267" y="172">noun</text>
      <rect class="il-pill type-adverb" x="308" y="160" width="72" height="24" rx="12" /><text class="il-t il-p type-adverb" x="344" y="172">adverb</text>
      <rect class="il-pill type-clause" x="390" y="160" width="76" height="24" rx="12" /><text class="il-t il-p type-clause" x="428" y="172">clause</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Every result has a type, shown by colour. Each ending only accepts the type it needs.</figcaption>
</figure>
